rican Development Bank Issue of Debt -4-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                               where action for that purpose \par                                                               is required. Accordingly, the \par                                                               Dealer agrees that it will observe \par                                                               all applicable provisions of law \par                                                               in each jurisdiction in or from \par                                                               which it may offer or sell Notes \par                                                               or distribute any offering material. \par  Other Relevant Terms \par  1.                       Listing:                           Application has been made for \par                                                               the Notes to be admitted to the \par                                                               Official List of the United Kingdom \par                                                               Listing Authority and to trading \par                                                               on the \f28 \uc2 \f2 London Stock Exchange plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's \par                                                               Regulated Market. \par  2.                       Details of Clearance System \par                            Approved by the Bank and \par                            the \par                            Global Agent and Clearance         Euroclear Bank SA/NV and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Clearstream\f28 \uc2 \f2 , \par                            and                                Luxembourg \par                            Settlement Procedures: \par  3.                       Syndicated:                        No \par  4.                       Commissions and Concessions:       0.033907% of the Aggregate Principal \par   