, issued on July 26, 2018 (the "Series 553 Tranche 10 Notes")\par \par \uc2 payable in United States Dollars\par \par \uc2 Issue Price: 103.458 percent plus 343 days' accrued interest\par \par \uc2 Application has been made for the Notes to be admitted to the Official List of the United Kingdom Listing Authority and to trading on the \uc2 London Stock Exchange plc\uc2 's Regulated Market\par \par \uc2 TD Securities\par \par \uc2 The date of this Pricing Supplement is as of February 15, 2019\par \par \uc2 Terms used herein shall be deemed to be defined as such for the purposes of the Terms and Conditions (the "Conditions") set forth in the Prospectus dated January 8, 2001 (the "Prospectus") (which for the avoidance of doubt does not constitute a prospectus for the purposes of Part VI of the United Kingdom Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 or a base prospectus for the purposes of Directive 2003/71/EC of the \uc2 European Parliament\uc2  and of the Council). This Pricing Supplement must be read in conjunction with the Prospectus. This document is issued to give details of an issue by the \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\uc2  (the "Bank") under its Global Debt Program and to provide information supplemental to the Prospectus. Complete information in respect of the Bank and this offer of the Notes is only available on the basis of the combination of this Pricing Supplement and the Prospectus.\par \par \uc2 MiFID II product governance / Retail investors, professional investors and ECPs target market - See "General Information-Additional Information Regarding the Notes-Matters relating to MiFID II" below.\par \par \uc2 Terms and Conditions\par \par \uc2 The following items under this heading "Terms and Conditions" are the particular terms which relate to the issue the subject of this Pricing Supplement. These are the only terms which form part of the form of Notes for such issue. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par            1.              Series No.:                