r                             Amount:                          with the procedure specified herein, \par                                                              the Calculation Agent will determine \par                                                              the IDR Rate (as defined below) and \par                                                              calculate the amount of interest payable \par                                                              (the "Interest Amount") with respect \par                                                              to each minimum Authorized Denomination \par                                                              for the relevant Interest Period. \par                                                              The Interest Amount with respect to \par                                                              any Interest Period shall be a USD \par                                                              amount calculated on the relevant \par                                                              Rate Fixing Date (as defined below) \par                                                              as follows: \par                                                              7.875% times the minimum Authorized \par                                                              Denomination \par  \par                                                              times \par  \par                                                              the Fixed Rate Day Count Fraction \par  \par                                                              divided by \par  \par                                                              the IDR Rate \par  \par                                                              (and rounding, if necessary, the entire \par                                                              resulting figure to the nearest two \par                                             