\par                                                              practicable to the Noteholders in \par                                                              accordance with Condition 14 (Notices). \par            14.             Relevant Financial Center:       New York, London and Jakarta \par            15.             Relevant Business Day:           New York, London and Jakarta \par            16.             Redemption Amount (Condition \par                             6(a)):                            The Redemption Amount with respect \par                                                               to each minimum Authorized Denomination \par                                                               will be a USD amount calculated by \par                                                               the Calculation Agent as of the Rate \par                                                               Fixing Date with respect to the Maturity \par                                                               Date as follows: \par  \par                                                               minimum Authorized Denomination \par  \par                                                               divided by \par  \par                                                               the IDR Rate \par  \par                                                               (and rounding, if necessary, the entire \par                                                               resulting figure to the nearest 2 \par                                                               decimal places, with USD 0.005 being \par                                                               rounded upwards). \par            17.             Issuer's Optional Redemption \par                             (Condition 6(e)):                No \par            18.             Redemption at the Option \par                            of the Noteholders (Condition     No \par