                Bank and the Global Agent as soon \par                                                               as reasonably practicable that the \par                                                               IDR Rate is to be so determined. \par                            (g) Calculation Agent:            See "8. Identity of Calculation \par                                                               Agent" under "Other Relevant Terms" \par                            (h) Notification:                 If the Interest Amount payable on \par                                                               any Fixed Rate Interest Payment \par                                                               Date or the Redemption Amount, as \par                                                               the case may be, is calculated in \par                                                               any manner other than by utilizing \par                                                               the USD/IDR reference rate that \par                                                               appears on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's website \par                                                               (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ), or on Thomson Reuters \par                                                               Screen JISDOR Page (or on such replacement \par                                                               page as described above), or as \par                                                               otherwise made available by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank \par                                                               Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or its successor as administrator), \par                                                               the Global Agent on behalf of the \par                                                               B