Day prior to such payment, or, if \par                                                               the Calculation Agent determines \par                                                               that no such exchange rate is available \par                                                               as of such second Business Day, \par                                                               on the basis of the exchange rate \par                                                               most recently available prior to \par                                                               such second Business Day. In making \par                                                               such determinations, the Calculation \par                                                               Agent shall act in good faith and \par                                                               in a commercially reasonable manner \par                                                               having taken into account all available \par                                                               information that it shall deem relevant". \par  Other Relevant Terms \par  1.                        Listing:                          Application has been made for the \par                                                               Notes to be admitted to the Official \par                                                               List of the United Kingdom Listing \par                                                               Authority and to trading on the \par                                                               \f28 \uc2 \f2 London Stock Exchange plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Regulated \par                                                               Market. \par  2.                        Details of Clearance System \par                             Approved by the Bank and \par                             the \par                             Global Agent and Clearance         Euroclear Bank SA/NV and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Clearstream\f28 \uc2 \f2 , \par                             and                                Luxembourg \par                             Settlement Procedures: \par  3.                        Syndicated:                       No \par  4.                        Commissions and Concessions:      No commissions or concessions are \par                                                               payable in respect of the Notes. \par                                                               An affiliate of the Dealer has arranged \par                                                               a swap with the Bank in connection \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inter-American Development Bank Issue of Debt -5-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                               with this transaction and will receive \par                                                               amounts thereunder that may comprise \par                                                               compensation. \par  5.                        Estimated Total Expenses:         None. The Dealer has agreed to pay \par                                                               for all material expenses related \par                                                               to the issuance of the Notes. \par  6.                        Codes: \par                            (a) Common Code:                  191771907 \par                            (b) ISIN:                         XS1917719079 \par  7.                        Identity of Dealer:               \f28 \uc2 \f2 Deutsche Bank AG\f28 \uc2 \f2 , London Branch \par  8.                        Identity of Calculation           Deutsche Bank AG, Singapore Branch \par                             Agent: \par                                                               In relation to the Rate Fixing Date, \par                             