                                             Agent shall be entitled to calculate \par                                                              the IDR Rate acting in good faith \par                                                              in a commercially reasonable manner, \par                                                              having taken into account relevant \par                                                              market practice, by reference to \par                                                              such additional sources as it deems \par                                                              appropriate; and in such case the \par                                                              Calculation Agent shall notify \par                                                              the Bank and the Global Agent as \par                                                              soon as reasonably practicable \par                                                              that the IDR Rate is to be so determined. \par                            (g) Calculation Agent:           See "8. Identity of Calculation \par                                                              Agent" under "Other Relevant Terms" \par                            (h) Notification:                If the Interest Amount payable \par                                                              on any Fixed Rate Interest Payment \par                                                              Date or the Redemption Amount, \par                                                              as the case may be, is calculated \par                                                              in any manner other than by utilizing \par                                                              the USD/IDR reference rate that \par                                                              appears on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f