 ("U.S.$" \par                                          or "USD") \par  8.    Specified Principal Payment \par         \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par         (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)):      USD \par  9.    Specified Interest Payment \par         \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                          USD \par         (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)): \par  10.   Maturity Date \par         (Condition 6(a); Fixed            March 14, 2023 \par         Interest Rate): \par  11.   Interest Basis \par         (Condition 5):                   Fixed Interest Rate (Condition \par                                          5(I)) \par  12.   Interest Commencement Date \par         (Condition 5(III)):               March 14, 2017 \par  13.   Fixed Interest Rate (Condition   Condition 5(I) as amended and \par         5(I)):                           supplemented below, shall apply \par                                          to the Notes. The bases of the \par                                          Calculation of the Interest \par                                          Amount, Interest Payment Dates \par                                          and default interest are as \par                                          set out below. \par  \par          (a) Interest Rate:              7.875 percent per annum \par        (b) Business Day Convention:     Following Business Day Convention \par        (c) Fixed Rate Interest \par         Payment Date(s):                  Annually on each March 14, commencing \par                                           on March 14, 2018 and ending \par                                           on, and including, the Maturity \par                                           Date. \par                                           Each Interest Payment Date is \par                                           subject to adjustment in accordance \par                                        