y 8, 2001 (the "Prospectus") (which for the avoidance of doubt does not constitute a prospectus for the purposes of Part VI of the United Kingdom Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 or a base prospectus for the purposes of Directive 2003/71/EC of the \uc2 European Parliament\uc2  and of the Council). This Pricing Supplement must be read in conjunction with the Prospectus. This document is issued to give details of an issue by the \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\uc2  (the "Bank") under its Global Debt Program and to provide information supplemental to the Prospectus. Complete information in respect of the Bank and this offer of the Notes is only available on the basis of the combination of this Pricing Supplement and the Prospectus.\par \par \uc2 Terms and Conditions\par \par \uc2 The following items under this heading "Terms and Conditions" are the particular terms which relate to the issue the subject of this Pricing Supplement. These are the only terms which form part of the form of Notes for such issue. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  1.    Series No.:                      553 \par         Tranche No.:                     6 \par  2.    Aggregate Principal Amount:      IDR 1,645,000,000,000 \par                                          As from the Issue Date, the Notes \par                                          will be consolidated and form a \par                                          single series with the Series 553 \par                                          Tranche 1 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                          Tranche 2 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                          Tranche 3 Notes, the Series 553 \par                                          Tranche 4 Notes and the Series \par                                          553 Tranche 5 Notes. \par  3.    Issue Price:                         IDR 1,845,355,390,550 which amount \par                                             represents the sum of (a) 106.8