    Agent by requesting quotations \par                                          for the mid USD/IDR spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign \par                                          exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate from five banks active \par                                          in the USD/IDR \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign \par                                          exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets as selected by \par                                          the Calculation Agent (such banks, \par                                          the "Reference Banks") either (i) \par                                          at or about 10:00 a.m. Jakarta \par                                          time on the first day (other than \par                                          a Saturday or a Sunday) following \par                                          the Rate Fixing Date, if such day \par                                          is a Relevant Business Day or (ii) \par                                          at or about 10:00 a.m. Jakarta \par                                          time on the Rate Fixing Date, if \par                                          the first day (other than a Saturday \par                                          or a Sunday) following the Rate \par                                          Fixing Date is not a Relevant Business \par                                          Day. \par                                         If five or four quotations are \par                                          provided by Reference Banks as \par                                          requested, the IDR Rate shall be \par                                          the arithmetic mean (rounded to \par                                          the nearest whole IDR, with IDR \par                                          0.5 being rounded upwards)